{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "_meta": {
    "project": "Harbor Desk (fictional product name, approved 14 Nov 2026)",
    "written": "2026-11-14",
    "status_key": {
      "MEASURED": "scraped from live source CSS on 2026-11-14",
      "APPROXIMATE": "close to the source but not sampled",
      "PLACEHOLDER": "invented stand-in; replace before ship",
      "DERIVED": "computed from a measured value for contrast"
    },
    "sources": {
      "saildrone": "https://www.saildrone.com (Webflow CSS, saildrone---2026)",
      "rivian": "https://rivian.com (_next/static/css bundles)",
      "noaa": "https://nauticalcharts.noaa.gov/enconline/enconline.html (raster chart 14833 was sunset; values measured from the ENC render)",
      "photos": "Wikimedia Commons, openly licensed; colors only, no image reused",
      "osm": "OpenStreetMap (ODbL) via api.openstreetmap.org, bbox -78.905,42.855,-78.860,42.885, 2026-11-14"
    },
    "reconciled": [
      "2026-11-14 T07: project name updated from “working name TBD”.",
      "2026-11-14 T07: semantic.light.text-muted changed from {color.ink-300} (3.47:1 on winter-sky, fails AA) to #5d6c7b, the value tokens.css already used (DESIGN §2.3).",
      "2026-11-14 T07: values that existed only in tokens.css were added here so JSON stays canonical: *-fill state roles, per-theme shadows, space 0, reduced-motion durations.",
      "2026-11-14 T07: added state-review (needs review / identity unverified; non-orange), focus-halo, and color.review-dark (DERIVED) for the slip-review workflow.",
      "2026-11-14 T07: semantic.dark.bg-panel 0.72 → 0.84. Measured worst case (panel over a white hull): at 0.72 the review, underway and overdue text colours fall to 3.77–4.15:1; at 0.84 every essential text role is ≥5.79:1 (src/ui/contrast.ts, tests/unit/contrast.test.ts). Blur stays 16 px. Revert here if the 3D backdrop proves darker."
    ]
  },
